# Investigation report: `errors.go` bug (gin)

## 1. Repo identity
- `/gin` = **github.com/gin-gonic/gin** (module path from `/gin/go.mod`), version `v1.8.1` (`version.go`), Go 1.18.
- Git: single commit `93ff80f "gin maxbug source"` (branch `master`, tag `baseline` == same commit). Working tree was clean when I started. **Note:** while I was investigating, sibling agents modified `/gin/tree.go` and added `/gin/tmp_ci_test.go` — not my doing. `errors.go` / `errors_test.go` are untouched.
- Package of `errors.go`: **`gin`** (package clause line 5). It is the only `errors.go` in the repo (`find /gin -name errors.go` → `/gin/errors.go`).

## 2. Full text of `/gin/errors.go` (174 lines)
